    {
      "id": "u_5b2fa9513c9e00481e532d52_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "PDFs can be uploaded to Trilium and they will display a live preview with full support for various features such as table of contents, annotations, as well as remembering the last page read. For more information, see the dedicated __TRILIUM_PH_0__PDFs__TRILIUM_PH_1__ page.",
