    {
      "id": "u_117104e502e69bf2b8a33b3a_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Text files__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "117104e502e69bf2b8a33b3a2d5bb901bc1c903d9e979f1cc7bffb2ebb1b8e12",
      "context": "File > Office documents > Text files",
      "contextHash": "5d786d1125266dd3a98ccc068d0de4c282fa55c6fcf158aa736ad27f978bca21",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6cfb97ed3efdb75c9e51f95d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Files that are identified as containing text will show a preview of their content. One common use case for this type of file is to embed text files whose content is not necessarily of interest to the user, such as third-party libraries or generated content, that can then be downloaded if needed.",
      "sourceHash": "6cfb97ed3efdb75c9e51f95db0b147beda7e82167b4a5dc1338a3cc1e86a0ee7",
      "context": "File > Office documents > Text files",
      "contextHash": "5d786d1125266dd3a98ccc068d0de4c282fa55c6fcf158aa736ad27f978bca21",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b5acf47299707c8ca47340e6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that generally text files will be __TRILIUM_PH_0__imported__TRILIUM_PH_1__ as either __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Code__TRILIUM_PH_5__ notes. To bypass this behavior and create a __TRILIUM_PH_6__File__TRILIUM_PH_7__ note type, use the __TRILIUM_PH_8__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_9__ feature and uncheck __TRILIUM_PH_10__Import HTML, Markdown and TXT as text notes__TRILIUM_PH_11__, as well as __TRILIUM_PH_12__Import recognized code files as code notes__TRILIUM_PH_13__. ",
      "sourceHash": "b5acf47299707c8ca47340e68bc31406187ff13789b8ae15c8ffcfbfcb198065",
      "context": "File > Office documents > Text files",
      "contextHash": "5d786d1125266dd3a98ccc068d0de4c282fa55c6fcf158aa736ad27f978bca21",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_62b1b23c0a5ce753a262420b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since one of the use cases for having files instead of notes is to display large files, the content preview is limited to a relatively small amount of characters. To view the full file, consider opening it in an external application.",
      "sourceHash": "62b1b23c0a5ce753a262420b898f12409472068de74879c31f99c7f0be0160e9",
      "context": "File > Office documents > Text files",
      "contextHash": "5d786d1125266dd3a98ccc068d0de4c282fa55c6fcf158aa736ad27f978bca21",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
